/washington-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Washington Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/washington-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Washington Parish runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 53% of normal in Nov-Dec and 56% in Sep-Oct. So far in 2026 it ran 61% in Feb-Mar, then 185% in May-Jun. Grid 13060 had its driest year in 2000 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
